            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5368500?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Updates the API property template to include the short-title and the formalized text we now use for the first sentence.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I also added info about when description is OK and pointed out that the Value is more and more likely just to be about the data type and allowed values than a description that duplicates the main description (as it said).</p>",
